<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!--
        Solid glyphs on a 24-unit grid. Solid rather than stroked because thin outlines wash
        out in direct sunlight and behind a scratched screen protector, which is where this
        app gets used. Every path is straight lines and circular arcs only: Uno's Path
        mini-language throws on elliptical arcs, and that would be a startup crash.

        Always host these in a Viewbox — PathIcon clips instead of scaling when it is sized
        below the geometry's own bounds.
    -->

